# Amiss - environment template
#
# Copy this file to `.env` if your tooling reads a dotenv file, then fill in
# your own values. The `.env` file itself is never committed.
#
# The default judge path is the recorded-fixture path. It needs no network and
# no credential, so the assignment below may stay empty. The local-live path is
# optional and uses your own Meta Model API key: on a headset the key is entered
# in the app settings, and on a desktop build or in the Unity Editor it is read
# from the process environment.
# A blank value means "not configured"; a path that needs a value and finds none
# fails closed with a readable reason instead of guessing.
#
# Leave the value side empty in this file. Do not commit a populated `.env`, and
# do not paste a key into a comment, a fixture, a log, or a screenshot.

# Your own Meta Model API key for the optional local-live evaluation path.
# Leave empty to use recorded fixtures only.
AMISS_EVAL_META_MODEL_API_KEY=
